      "1992E1: The separate answer sheet and actual titration volumes, calcium carbonate mass and pH measurements are absent from these obtained pages. No numerical solubility or measured entries are invented. The source's hygroscopicity note is retained; its 1.2 ionic-species list omits carbonate although 1.3 separately asks about carbonate concentration. Both complete procedures, all four connected tasks and the printed key remain one whole experiment.\n\nAttributed archive/compiler source: Anton Sirota (editor), *The Competition Problems from the International Chemistry Olympiads*, Volume 2, IChO International Information Centre, Bratislava, IUVENTA, 2009. Retain the teaching-copy/distribution attribution and rights notice; no broader commercial licence or unchanged complete jury edition is asserted."
